*-----------------------------------------------------------------------
*  ADSC DIALOG DEFINITION      BUSINESS MILEAGE CLAIM
*-----------------------------------------------------------------------
ADD DIALOG FLEMILE VERSION 1
    DESCRIPTION IS 'BUSINESS MILEAGE CLAIM'
    SUBSCHEMA IS FLEETSS1 OF SCHEMA FLEETSCH VERSION 1
    MAP IS FLEMILEM VERSION 1
    WORK RECORD IS FLEWORK
    PREMAP PROCESS IS FLEMILE-PREMAP
    RESPONSE PROCESS IS FLEMILE-ENTER  RESPONSE KEY IS ENTER
       EXECUTE ON EDIT ERRORS
    RESPONSE PROCESS IS FLEMILE-PF3    RESPONSE KEY IS PF3
    .
